# Blog Migrator - Quick Reference

## Run the tool
```bash
npm start
```

## Config location
`src/config.js`

## Add new URLs
Add to `config.URLS` array:
```js
URLS: [
    "https://example.com/new-post/",
    // ...existing URLs
]
```

## Add new frontmatter field

### Static value
```js
DATA: {
    NEW_FIELD: "static value",
}
```

### Dynamic value from page
```js
DATA: {
    NEW_FIELD: {
        selector: "CSS selector",
        getValue: (el) => el.textContent.trim(),
    },
}
```

## Change image selectors
```js
IMAGE_EXTRACTION: {
    selector: "new-selector",
    getValue: (el) => el.src,  // or el.href, el.dataset.src, etc.
}
```

## Disable featured image
```js
IMAGE_EXTRACTION: {
    featuredImage: null,  // Set to null to disable
}
```

## Change output directories
```js
OUTPUT: {
    CONTENT_DIR: "./new/content/path",
    IMAGES_DIR: "./new/images/path",
}
```

## Change filename patterns
```js
// Body images: {slug} and {index} available
filenamePattern: "{slug}-image-{index}"   // → slug-image-01.jpg

// Featured image: {slug} available
filenamePattern: "{slug}-hero"            // → slug-hero.jpg
```

## Common getValue patterns
```js
// Text content
getValue: (el) => el.textContent.trim()

// Attribute
getValue: (el) => el.getAttribute("content")

// href/src
getValue: (el) => el.href
getValue: (el) => el.src

// Data attribute
getValue: (el) => el.dataset.src || el.src

// Background image (with quote stripping)
getValue: (el) => el.style.backgroundImage.replace(/url\(['"]?/, '').replace(/['"]?\)/, '')

// With fallback
getValue: (el) => el.alt || el.title || ''
```

## Output format

### Frontmatter
```yaml
---
title: Page Title
description: Meta description
author: Author Name
date: 2024-01-15T00:00:00+00:00
category: Category
featuredImage: /assets/uploads/slug-featured.jpg
featuredImageAlt: Alt text
---
```

### Content
Markdown with rewritten image paths:
```markdown
![Alt text](/assets/uploads/slug-01.jpg)

Paragraph content here...

![Another image](/assets/uploads/slug-02.jpg)
```
